@startuml application-status
' The status of one application over its life: every status is reachable
' and every change says what causes it.
title Application status
footer owner: Retail Credit · CRD-102 CRD-104 CRD-105

[*] --> Submitted
Submitted --> Incomplete : documentsMissing
Incomplete --> Submitted : documentsReceived
Submitted --> Scored : scoreComputed
Scored --> Approved : approve [score sufficient]
Scored --> Rejected : reject [score insufficient]
Approved --> Closed : customerInformed
Rejected --> Closed : customerInformed
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
